  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the diced red bell pepper and cook until it is tender",
    "Add the bean sprouts, chili flakes, cumin, salt, and black pepper to the skillet",
    "Stir well to combine",
    "Pressure-cook the mixture for 5 minutes",
    "Let the pressure release naturally",
    "Serve the skillet hot"
